# Every .env variant, not just *.local. @expo/env loads .env.production and
# .env.development too, and EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are inlined into the shipped bundle — so a
# committed mobile/.env.production would bake a developer's LAN address into a store build.
.env*
!.env.example

